## Don't

- Don't edit `.env*` files
- Don't run `npm publish`
- Don't commit `~/.local/share/opencode/auth.json` (it's user-local anyway)

## Use the `plan` agent for unfamiliar areas

`opencode run "..." --agent plan` for read-only exploration before writing.

## Use the `bulk` agent for cheap mass operations

Configured to use Groq for ~10× speed + cost reduction.

## CI

